# QA M7 (ending input): the relaxed run in the title flow, then START mashed
# (1 frame on, 1 off) from frame 4037, 20 frames into the ending's Map.
# Every phase skips at its first allowed frame (30, 60 in Bill and Ende):
# the ending lasts 360 frames (4017 -> 4377), then the marked title. Re-cut
